<p>Dear Finance Team,</p>

<p>The Australian Taxation Office (ATO) has processed your Business Activity Statement (BAS) for the September 2026 quarter and determined that you are eligible for a refund of <b>AUD $21,845.63</b>.</p>

<h3>Refund Details</h3>
